[00:19.430]In the dusty basement where we met
{"在我们相遇的尘土飞扬地下室"}
[00:25.000]May you surprised me so much
{"你让我如此惊讶"}
[00:29.260]Because you're talking now
{"因为你此刻正在诉说"}
[00:34.580]I gotta find the truth from many fights
{"我必须在无数战斗中寻找真相"}
[00:39.850]But I'm all alone
{"但我孤身一人"}
[00:41.470]You're the only one who can help me out
{"唯有你能助我脱困"}
[00:45.520]We'll be as one
{"我们将合而为一"}
[00:47.920]
[00:49.790]We're ready to fight
{"我们已准备好战斗"}
[00:51.840]Look over there
{"看那边"}
[00:53.680]They try to kill us for stars
{"他们为星辰企图杀害我们"}
[00:57.760]Our bond has got much stronger than before
{"我们的羁绊比从前更加坚固"}
[01:04.050]
[01:04.740]Don't lose your way in your mind
{"别在内心迷失方向"}
[01:09.180]We have to be as one
{"我们必须融为一体"}
[01:12.740]Don't be afraid my sweet heart
{"别害怕我亲爱的"}
[01:17.290]This is the way to be more strong
{"这是变强的必经之路"}
[01:21.230]Harbor my deep secret
{"藏匿我深沉的秘密"}
[01:25.190]It makes me so blue
{"这让我忧郁不堪"}
[01:29.080]Run through this game before my body is dry
{"趁身体未枯竭前闯过这场游戏"}
[01:38.590]
[01:53.910]So it seems there's No other choice
{"看来已别无选择"}
[01:55.580]But to go all out
{"唯有全力以赴"}
[01:56.420]Stay with me and let's stand out
{"留在我身边让我们脱颖而出"}
[01:58.330]and out shine those trying to get our stars now
{"光芒盖过那些觊觎星辰之人"}
[02:01.120]All we have to do is figure out how strong we are
{"只需弄清我们有多强大"}
[02:04.420]and what it takes to stay dive
{"以及坚守需要付出什么"}
[02:06.180]Sync and learn what we can do to take 'em down
{"同步并领悟击溃他们的方法"}
[02:08.940]It's revenge and survive
{"这是复仇与生存"}
[02:10.300]For now,we know in part
{"此刻 我们仅知部分真相"}
[02:12.090]And You can feel my heart
{"你能感受到我的心跳"}
[02:14.010]So help me to stay focused so I don't fall apart
{"请助我保持专注 以免分崩离析"}
[02:18.050]I wanna be complete
{"我渴望变得完整"}
[02:20.070]It's not in me to retreat
{"退缩绝非我的本性"}
[02:21.870]I could lose on my own so I really need you with me
{"独自前行恐将失败 故需你并肩同行"}
[02:25.840]
[02:26.400]I gotta find out who killed my dad
{"我必须查出杀害父亲的凶手"}
[02:30.500]I hear the voice of you in my mind
{"脑海中回荡着你的声音"}
[02:34.380]I gotta find out who killed my dad
{"我必须查出杀害父亲的凶手"}
[02:38.460]I hear the voice of you in my mind so
