{"热血正在沸腾"}
[02:46.360]I'm ready to fight when you are
{"当你准备就绪 我亦蓄势待发"}
[02:48.870]Let's let no one break the bond that is ours
{"绝不让任何人破坏我们的羁绊"}
[02:52.560]Show them what it means to be a shining star
{"让他们见识何为璀璨星辰"}
[02:55.790]You have my body
